title = "Active shield"
price = 499
description = "Say goodbye to space hazards. The A.S. (SHELL SHIELD) absorbs every asteroid in your path — no exceptions. Powered by advanced kinetic energy conversion, this shield neutralizes impacts before they reach your hull, turning danger into harmless energy. Lightweight, ultra-responsive, and engineered for relentless protection, AsteroidGuard keeps your mission moving safely through even the densest asteroid fields."
