[center][b][color=#EBCB8B]Terms of Continued Engagement (TCE)[/color][/b][/center]

By initiating, activating, contemplating, or otherwise interacting with the Selected Item (hereinafter referred to as \"[b]The Product[/b]\"), the user (hereinafter referred to as \"[i]You[/i]\") hereby consents — either knowingly or unknowingly — to a dynamic, usage-contingent engagement model.

Said model may, from time to time (or continuously), assess a [b]Value Recognition Fee (VRF)[/b], billed in perpetuity, at a rate [i]not to exceed (but not limited to)[/i] [color=#A3BE8C]one (1) United States Dollar per Moment of Utilization (MoU)[/color].

[quote]A [b]Moment of Utilization[/b] is defined, without specificity, as any measurable or immeasurable unit of time during which The Product is:  
(a) in use  
(b) not in use but could be  
(c) thought about in relation to use, including hypotheticals[/quote]

The Product may employ proprietary methods (including but not limited to [i]ethereal accounting[/i], [i]quantum guesswork[/i], or [i]ambient telemetry[/i]) to assess usage. Failure to comply, unsubscribe, or acknowledge these terms shall be considered [b]acceptance by default[/b].

[b]The subscription is:[/b]
• [i]Non-cancelable[/i]  
• [i]Auto-renewing[/i]  
• [i]May apply retroactively, preemptively, or in parallel dimensions[/i]

[center][color=#BF616A][b]Enjoy your Product.[/b][/color][/center]"
